# Daily Gamba CRM - environment template
#
# Copy this to .env.local and fill in the real values.
# .env.local is gitignored; this file is committed so anyone setting the project
# up knows what they need.
#
# Both values come from Supabase > Settings > API.
#
# The publishable key is safe in a browser. Row Level Security is what protects
# the data - a rep holding this key can still only read their own players.
#
# The SECRET key bypasses RLS completely. It never goes in a file in this repo.
# If something server-side ever needs it, it goes in Vercel's environment
# variables directly.

NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=https://your-project-ref.supabase.co
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=sb_publishable_xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx
